WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.763
distinctUI@work. The same calm look, for the apps people use all day.

00:00:06.213 --> 00:00:12.959
Black, white and grey. Colour only on people's rings, and your company's colour on its mark.

00:00:13.409 --> 00:00:24.569
Meet Brightwater Logistics, an invented company with four apps: Quarry for contracts, Intake for hiring, Kettle for support, and Roster for shifts.

00:00:25.019 --> 00:00:31.096
Tables stay dense, with saved views. Tick a few rows, and a black bar swaps in.

00:00:31.546 --> 00:00:36.082
Nothing asks "are you sure?". Every change comes with Undo.

00:00:36.532 --> 00:00:43.808
Approvals keep who asked apart from who signs. The last ring stays dashed until Lerato signs.

00:00:44.258 --> 00:00:50.386
Press ⌘K to find anything. Shortcuts show as key caps, and you can switch them off.

00:00:50.836 --> 00:00:56.896
Reports compare in black, on one scale. And personal details are need-to-know.

00:00:57.346 --> 00:01:02.769
Every state is drawn: loading, empty, broken, and not allowed.

00:01:03.219 --> 00:01:08.526
Seventeen templates and nine extra rules. The twelve rules still hold.

00:01:08.976 --> 00:01:16.896
Ask Claude in a sentence: "Build a leave and claims app with distinctUI@work."

00:01:17.696 --> 00:01:23.822
distinctUI@work. Free, at distinctui.com/work.

